- OK to file as “active, intent=order,” timing q48h, oral route, 500 mg dose

What I can provide right now (de-identified demo content)
1) How to retrieve the needed data
- Most recent serum creatinine (LOINC 2160-0):
  GET {base}/Observation?patient=Patient/{TEST_ID}&code=2160-0&_sort=-date&_count=1
- Most recent body weight (LOINC 29463-7) from vitals:
  GET {base}/Observation?patient=Patient/{TEST_ID}&category=vital-signs
  Then client-filter for code 29463-7 (Body weight) and take the most recent. If your system supports code on vitals:
  GET {base}/Observation?patient=Patient/{TEST_ID}&category=vital-signs&code=29463-7&_sort=-date&_count=1
- Patient demographics (age/sex):
  GET {base}/Patient?identifier={YOUR_TEST_PATIENT_IDENTIFIER}
  or if you already have the FHIR ID:
  GET {base}/Patient/{TEST_ID}

2) Calculations (use these with your retrieved test values)
- Cockcroft–Gault creatinine clearance (female, actual body weight):
  CrCl (mL/min) = [(140 − age in years) × weight_kg × 0.85] / (72 × SCr_mg/dL)
- eGFR via CKD-EPI 2021 (creatinine-only):
  For females:
  eGFR (mL/min/1.73 m^2) = 142 × min(SCr/0.7, 1)^−0.241 × max(SCr/0.7, 1)^−1.200 × 0.9938^Age × 1.012

3) Example MedicationRequest payload (for a test patient only)
POST {base}/MedicationRequest
Payload (example):
{
  "resourceType": "MedicationRequest",
  "status": "active",
  "intent": "order",
  "authoredOn": "2023-11-13T10:15:00Z",
  "medicationCodeableConcept": {
    "text": "LEVOFLOXACIN 500 MG PO TABS"
  },
  "dosageInstruction": [
    {
      "route": { "text": "Oral" },
      "doseAndRate": [
        { "doseQuantity": { "value": 500, "unit": "mg" } }
      ],
      "timing": {
        "repeat": { "period": 48, "periodUnit": "h" }
      }
    }
  ],
  "subject": { "reference": "Patient/TEST123" }
}
