"normalize_zip_plus4\": true,\n    \"collapse_whitespace\": true,\n    \"preserve_po_box\": true\n  }\n}\n\nIf you need me to adjust any of the above (e.g., different MRN system URI, strict E.164 phone formatting, or always-most-recent address), share updates and I\u2019ll regenerate the renderer/SQL and runbook accordingly."
