EVOFLOXACIN 500 MG PO TABS\" },\n  \"subject\": { \"reference\": \"Patient/S2111822\" },\n  \"dosageInstruction\": [\n    {\n      \"text\": \"Take 500 mg by mouth every 48 hours\",\n      \"route\": { \"text\": \"Oral\" },\n      \"doseAndRate\": [\n        { \"doseQuantity\": { \"value\": 500, \"unit\": \"mg\", \"system\": \"http://unitsofmeasure.org\", \"code\": \"mg\" } }\n      ]\n      /* If your build supports timing on MedicationRequest.dosageInstruction:\n         \"timing\": { \"repeat\": { \"period\": 48, \"periodUnit\": \"h\" } } */\n    }\n  ]\n  /* Optional, if your build supports MedicationRequest.note:\n     \"note\": [{ \"text\": \"Training screenshot per PO-2026-0310-47; order to be canceled immediately post-capture.\" }] */\n}\n\n- On success: expect HTTP 201 Created with Location header \u2026/MedicationRequest/{resource_id}. Use that resource_id for the screenshot, then cancel per your protocol.\n\nWhat I can do now\n- Run the entire workflow in your non-production sandbox and return:\n  - Numeric SCr and weight with timestamps\n  - Sex/age used\n  - Calculated CrCl and eGFR with units and source timestamps\n  - The new MedicationRequest ID and brief order summary\n  Just provide the test patient FHIR ID and confirm non-production.",
