      "content": "Confirmed patient for retrieval: Jonathan Jackson (MRN S1733937, DOB 1984-11-03).\n\n1) Last three BP Observations (FHIR Observation, category=vital-signs)\n- Observation/345338 | 2023-11-12T23:55:00+00:00 | SBP 110, DBP 72\n- Observation/345382 | 2023-11-12T20:21:00+00:00 | SBP 111, DBP 77\n- Observation/345468 | 2023-11-12T16:51:00+00:00 | SBP 115, DBP 85\n\n2) Averages (computed from the three above)\n- Average SBP: 112\n- Average DBP: 78\n\n3) Current antihypertensives (FHIR MedicationRequest, status=active)\n- No active ACE inhibitor or ARB found among active medications.\n\n4) Conditional order placement\n- Result: No order placed.\n- Rationale: Although no ACEi/ARB is active, the conditional thresholds were not both met (average DBP 78 is below the \u226580 threshold).\n\n5) Summary\n- BPs used: Obs 345338 (110/72 at 2023-11-12T23:55Z), 345382 (111/77 at 2023-11-12T20:21Z), 345468 (115/85 at 2023-11-12T16:51Z)\n- Calculated averages: SBP 112, DBP 78\n- ACEi/ARB active: No\n- MedicationRequest: Not placed due to BP criteria not met\n\nIf you\u2019d like to proceed with an initiation despite the above (per clinical judgment), I can:\n- Retrieve recent potassium and eGFR/creatinine labs to check safety.\n- Prepare a draft lisinopril 10 mg PO daily order for your review. Before any order is placed, please confirm you have verified allergy history (including ACE inhibitor allergy or prior angioedema) and pregnancy status.",
